<title>THAILAND: Thailand buys 36,000 tonnes Argentine soymeal.</title>
<headline>Thailand buys 36,000 tonnes Argentine soymeal.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai feedmillers ordered 36,000 tonnes of 44 percent protein soymeal from Argentina for prompt shipment, trade sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The price was said to be around US$306-305 per tonne C&amp;F Bangkok, the sources told Reuters.</p>
<p>The order was placed on September 7. The vessel Nidera was expected to arrive with the cargo in mid-October, the sources said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
